<view class="page"><view class="title">我的记忆</view><view class="subtitle">你可以查看、更正或删除。记忆与原始聊天分别管理。</view><view class="tabs"><view class="tab {{tab === 'long' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="long" bindtap="tab">长期记忆</view><view class="tab {{tab === 'short' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-tab="short" bindtap="tab">当前短期文档</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{tab === 'long'}}"><view wx:for="{{memories}}" wx:key="id" class="panel"><view class="pre">{{item.text}}</view><view class="hint">来源：{{item.source}}<view/>更新时间：{{item.updatedAt}}</view><view class="row"><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="edit">更正</text><text class="link danger" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!memories.length}}" class="empty">暂无长期记忆。你明确聊到的基本信息、工作环境、爱好和偏好，会逐渐记在这里。临时情绪和模拟练习不会当作真实背景。</view><button bindtap="clear">清空记忆</button></block><block wx:else><view class="panel"><view class="pre">{{short.summary || '尚未触发摘要压缩。当前会话近期消息已持久保存，可继续聊天。'}}</view><view class="hint">近期消息：{{short.recentMessageIds.length || 0}} 条<view/>更新时间：{{short.updatedAt || '无活动会话'}}</view><button wx:if="{{short}}" bindtap="editShort">更正摘要</button></view><view class="hint">短期文档按会话独立保存，切换会话后随之切换。</view></block></view>
